# Shambler (R3, the Dead): hunched, head low and forward, arms hanging ahead, one leg short (a limp).
# Its one light cue: two dim rot-green eyes. The Brute row wears it at a bigger scale.
name shambler
grid 5
size 18 14 34
slot body Flesh
slot rag InkBrown
slot eye Rot
box 6 3 0 9 6 15 rag
box 6 8 0 9 11 13 rag
box 5 3 14 11 11 22 rag
box 8 3 21 14 11 27 body
box 12 5 24 17 9 30 body
box 16 4 27 17 6 29 eye
box 16 8 27 17 10 29 eye
beam 11 2 26 17 1 16 1.2 body
beam 11 12 26 16 13 18 1.2 body
noise 0.15 7 rag
pivot 8 7 0
